:: Bedroom Machine Widgets [widget]

<<widget "bedroom_machine">>
	<<if $player.vaginaExist and $machineVaginalBought>>
		<<sextoysicon "dildo">><<link [[질용 섹스 머신을 사용한다|Bedroom Machine]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $machineAnalBought>>
		<<sextoysicon "smalldildo">><<link [[항문용 섹스 머신을 사용한다|Bedroom Machine]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<if $player.vaginaExist and $machineVaginalBought and $machineAnalBought>>
		<<sextoysicon "dildo">><<link [[두 섹스 머신을 모두 사용한다|Bedroom Machine]]>><<set $sexstart to 1>><<set $phase to 3>><</link>>
		<br>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

:: Bedroom Machine

<<if $sexstart is 1>>
	<<if !wornSetupClothes("lower").skirt or !wornSetupClothes("lower").short>><<lowerstrip>><<set $machineundressed to 1>><</if>>
	<<if $worn.under_lower.name isnot "naked">><<underlowerstrip>><<set $machineundressed to 1>><</if>>
	<<set $sexstart to 0>>
	<<set $consensual to 1>>
	<<set $boughtMachine to 1>>
	<<neutral 1>>

	<<set $machine_health to 10>><<set $machine_ammo to 20>>
	<<if $phase is 1>>
		<<machine_init vaginal arm_chains leg_chains>>
	<<elseif $phase is 2>>
		<<machine_init anal arm_chains leg_chains>>
	<<elseif $phase is 3>>
		<<machine_init vaginal anal arm_chains leg_chains>>
	<</if>>
	<<set $phase to 0>>
<</if>>

<<if $phase is 0>>
	당신은 옷장에서 기계를 꺼내 부품을 서둘러 조립한다.
	<br><br>
	당신은 <<= $worn.lower.name isnot "naked" or $worn.under_lower.name isnot "naked"? "방해되는 옷을 모두 벗고 ": "">>기계의 구속구를 팔다리에 단단히 채우고, 마침내 곧 찾아올 쾌감을 기대하며 자세를 잡고 몸을 맡긴다.
	<<set $phase to 1>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<effects>>

<<machine_effects>><<machine_combat>>
<<machine_state>>

<<machine_actions>>

<<if $machine.number lte 0 or $finish is 1>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Bedroom Machine End]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[다음|Bedroom Machine]]>><</link>></span><<nexttext>>
<</if>>


:: Bedroom Machine End
<<effects>>

<<if $machine.number lte 0>>
	마침내 어떻게든 전원 스위치를 내리자 기계가 멈춰 잠잠해진다. <<tearful>> 당신은 구속구를 푼다<<= $machineundressed? " 그리고 아까 벗어 둔 옷을 다시 입는다":"">>.
<<else>>
	제 기능을 다한 기계의 사전 설정 주기가 마침내 끝난다. <<tearful>> 기계가 자동으로 구속구를 풀어 준다<<= $machineundressed? ". 당신은 몸을 일으켜 아까 벗어 둔 옷을 다시 입는다":"">>.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<clotheson>>
<<machine_end>>
<<unset $machineundressed>>
<<unset $boughtMachine>>

당신은 기계를 분해해 옷장 안에 안전하게 다시 넣어 둔다.
<br><br>
<<if $location is "home">>
	<<link [[다음|Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif $location is "alex_cottage">>
	<<link [[다음|Farm Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	이 문구가 보인다면 어떻게 된 일인지 꼭 제보해 주십시오.
	<br>
	<<link [[다음|Bedroom]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
